<title>USA: NCAA BASKETBALL-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NCAA BASKETBALL-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional semifinal results</p>
<p>in the 1997 NCAA men's college basketball tournament Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes regional seeding):</p>
<p>Midwest Region (at San Antonio, Texas)</p>
<p> 1-Minnesota	    90    4-Clemson		 84 (OT2)</p>
<p> 2-UCLA		   74    6-Iowa St		 73 (OT)</p>
<p>West Region (at San Jose, California)</p>
<p> 2-Utah		   82    6-Stanford		77 (OT)</p>
<p> 1-Kentucky	     83    4-St Josephs Pa.	68</p>
</text>
